WEBVTT

00:10:32.151 --> 00:10:38.261
(Pljesak)

00:10:41.228 --> 00:10:45.429
"Srce žvače suze vremena

00:10:45.464 --> 00:10:48.296
zasljepljeno tim svjetlom,

00:10:48.331 --> 00:10:51.706
skriva brzinu postojanja

00:10:51.741 --> 00:10:53.364
gdje veslaju slike,

00:10:53.399 --> 00:10:56.787
bori se, ne prepušta se.

00:10:56.822 --> 00:11:00.519
Srce napukne pod tužnim pogledima,